STATUS
------
This project is source-available, NOT open source. The source is public so the
scope gate, the catalogue and the protocol code can be read and reviewed. It
remains a Pixelcity project; the permissions below are the only ones granted.

INTENT
------
The author intends to relicense this project (likely under Apache-2.0 or AGPL-3.0)
once two conditions are met:

  1. The authorisation gate in docs/03-RULES-OF-ENGAGEMENT.md has survived an
     external review.
  2. The attack catalogue has been classified and the destructive classes are
     documented rather than shipped.

Until then, treat this as "all rights reserved" except for the limited permission
below.

